{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_04_end",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_04",
  "title": "掌柜",
  "storyCode": "WR-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c57e7e536efe85130e9c94792a069b5473d9ca57b9fcd6577d274a864fb3145f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "呜呜，呜呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "小姑娘呀，你看这天色都亮起来了，咱们也走了挺远的了，就快到了，别哭了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哎呀，有哥哥陪着你，可安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唉......别哭啦别哭啦，都能看到园子了，马上就到啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "咿呀呀——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "怎、怎么这边也有！不是说它们怕太阳的吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "来，你......你骑我头上，抓稳了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "叔叔！叔叔你跑快点啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "别，别揪我头发！眼镜要掉了，要掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎啊！嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......乌有这家伙，跑得倒是真挺快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "text": "英雄，您在说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "嗯？啊，没什么，你们快去院子里躲着，外面的警戒交给我就好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "那个体型的小墨魉，似乎比寻常的源石虫要迅速一些......不过好像有点被绕晕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "竟然真的跑不过乌有哎......？还有这种事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "嘎......嘎啊......嘎啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "看招！嘿！喝！呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哈哈！过不来了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "叔叔！你就不能快点跑吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "我早就想这么干了，那些电影里的功夫明星，在街上追逐时一定要掀点什么的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "快、快跑！快跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "别打我脑袋！真把我当驮兽啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "绕过来了！？这都太阳照屁股了，不是说这些玩意怕光的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "救，救命呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啧！喂，小姑娘，你先走，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎......嘎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......是克洛丝恩人！哎哟喂，大恩人呐，您要是帮得到，就早点帮我呀，呃，您、您在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "在这里哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "呀......！姐、姐姐你从哪里冒出来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哇！不愧是非同凡响的狙击能手，神出鬼没，落地无声，实在是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "姐姐！谢谢你救了叔叔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "赶快回家吧，你妈妈找你很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人呐，您要不赶紧去帮帮炎熔和嵯峨二位？这儿让我守着，保证周全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......你刚才是不是在炎熔那儿信誓旦旦地说会回去帮她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩、恩人，莫非您有那顺风耳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "没有哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "你这把扇子，怎么一直握在手上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "欸，那必须的，这把扇子可是我最钟爱的物件，乃是我那授业恩师相赠，可舍不得放下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "再说，嘿，手里捧个扇子，不是显得我斯文嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "哼嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "刚才那只墨魉，为什么到了这里也没事？这里算是白天了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我也想问啊，给那玩意儿追得可累了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "嗯......总之，先去找小炎熔吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......变安静了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这里明明是在黑夜边缘，只能看见一点点黎明，为什么没有怪物冲向这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧也觉得奇怪，从未如此安静过呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "安静些，不是好事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嘿！也确是如此，小僧也总算可以喘口气啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嘿咻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "小心些，别压坏了货件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嵯峨，刚才你说的夕娥......那是指？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "自然是“夕娥奔月”这段佳话中的那位夕娥了，哎呀，小僧至今也忘不掉夕娥那双眸子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......？？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "嵯峨，你慢点说。炎熔小姐的脸色越来越古怪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "哦，抱歉抱歉，是小僧心急了。方才抵御墨魉，想必炎熔小姐也乏了吧？不如坐下喝杯茶，咱们好好叙叙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "好，那我去为两位泡壶茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "对了，小僧想先问一句，黎姑娘可知道离开这里的办法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "不知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "（轻轻摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
